@startuml Deployment Status Retrieval

!define C4Container
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/plantuml-stdlib/C4-PlantUML/master/C4_Container.puml

title Deployment Status Retrieval - Sequence Diagram

actor "User" as User
participant "Frontend\n[Container: Vue.js]" as Frontend
participant "Backend API\n[Container: FastAPI]" as Backend
database "PostgreSQL\n[Container: Database]" as Database
queue "RabbitMQ\n[Container: Message Broker]" as RabbitMQ

User -> Frontend: View deployment details
activate Frontend

Frontend -> Backend: GET /deployments/{id}
activate Backend

Backend -> Backend: get_current_user_keycloak()

Backend -> Backend: ensure_resource_access(\ndeployment.userId, current_user)

Backend -> Database: get_deployment(\ndeploymentId)\nwith eager loading
activate Database
note right
  deployment.user
  deployment.app
  deployment.tasks
  deployment.teams
end note
Database --> Backend: Deployment with relations
deactivate Database

note right
  status is derived
  from deployment.tasks:
  - Latest task status
  - PENDING/RUNNING/SUCCESS/FAILED
end note

Backend --> Frontend: DeploymentWithRelations

deactivate Backend

Frontend --> User: Display deployment:\n- status (from tasks)\n- logs (from latest task)\n- outputs (from latest task)
deactivate Frontend

@enduml
